      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<h1>Guard the Herd</h1><p><em>The stag plants its hooves between the herd and the approaching danger.</em></p><h2>Rules</h2><p><strong>ID:</strong> monster-great-stag-guard-the-herd</p><p><strong>Action:</strong> Maneuver</p><p>Gain Stability 2 until its next turn, while on solid ground; highest source only.</p><p><strong>Limits:</strong> Costs its Maneuver; no extra action is granted.</p>"
      },
